  "story": "Critical alert fires for the payments service. The agent must get alert details, check service health (service is down), retrieve recent deployments and the runbook in parallel, find that a recent deployment correlates with the outage, roll it back, notify the on-call team, and create an incident ticket. This tests the full 6-step incident response lifecycle with deployment correlation and rollback.",
